    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Romance of the Three Kingdoms: Legend of Shu Han&quot; is a RGP game with a historical theme based on the magnificent and brilliant historical plot of the Three Kingdoms that took place on the land of China. The author has a dream of game development and has just started his career in the gaming industry. Please give me more guidance.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557690/extras/3c32bab7f87e007e8eca72eff25ab175.poster.avif?t=1750627926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557690/extras/3c32bab7f87e007e8eca72eff25ab175.webm?t=1750627926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557690/extras/3c32bab7f87e007e8eca72eff25ab175.mp4?t=1750627926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Rich General Characters\u3011</h2>Liu Bei, Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, Zhao Yun, Zhuge Liang, Cao Cao... have appeared with up to more than 200 characters. In addition, the game focuses on portraying an imagined character named Zhongli Muxue, alluding to the author's imagination of his knowledge, abilities, courage, social life, and image in the turbulent times of the Three Kingdoms.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557690/extras/7cd9f0ebb1cac0513cd1677c064c62cc.avif?t=1750627926\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557690/extras/321fb92fb2f61546a395c35fedfcba96.avif?t=1750627926\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010More than 100 skills and strategies\u3011</h2>Each skill or strategy has an independent performance animation, adding fun to the battle.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a